Error: Jet.HiddenCopyInLoop: This copy of `String` view into an owned slot inside a loop
  --> Tests/UI/cost_hidden_copy_in_loop.jet:15:18
    |
 15 |         out.push(trimmed)
    |                  ^^^^^^^
 Why: The loop pays for this copy on every turn and the source doesn't show it, so the loop's cost grows with the copied value's size.
 Fix: To keep the copy out of the loop, keep the value in its view form, or make the copy explicit outside the loop.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.HiddenCopyInLoop

Error: Jet.HiddenCopyInLoop: Implicitly copying a `String` inside a loop
  --> Tests/UI/cost_hidden_copy_in_loop.jet:23:49
    |
 23 |     loop turn in 0..<turns { out.push(Tag{name: label, turn: turn}) }
    |                                                 ^^^^^
 Why: The loop pays for this copy on every turn and the source doesn't show it, so the loop's cost grows with the copied value's size.
 Fix: To keep the copy out of the loop, hand the value over with `.move()` at its last use, or make the copy explicit outside the loop.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/Jet.HiddenCopyInLoop
